From: UniXNU kebab bring-up
Subject: [PATCH] bindfs: define BINDM_FORCE_ROOT

zzy-native-gpu-addon-mount.patch uses BINDM_FORCE_ROOT in bind_vfsops.c but
the hunk that defines it in bindfs.h is missing from this revision, so the
kernel fails to build with "use of undeclared identifier 'BINDM_FORCE_ROOT'".

Define the flag exactly as the companion patch expects.
---
diff --git a/bsd/miscfs/bindfs/bindfs.h b/bsd/miscfs/bindfs/bindfs.h
--- a/bsd/miscfs/bindfs/bindfs.h
+++ b/bsd/miscfs/bindfs/bindfs.h
@@ -81,4 +81,5 @@
 //#define BINDFS_DEBUG 0
 
 #define BINDM_CACHE 0x0001
+#define BINDM_FORCE_ROOT 0x80000000ULL
 #define BINDM_CASEINSENSITIVE 0x0000000000000002
